  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おだやかで　とても　じひぶかい。えいようほうふな　おいしい　オイルをよわった　ポケモンに　わけあたえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "온화하면서도 매우 자비롭다. 영양이 풍부한 맛있는 오일을 약해진 포켓몬에게 나눠 준다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性情溫和，慈悲為懷。會把營養豐富且美味可口的油分給虛弱的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Calme et bienveillant, il partage son huile délicieuse et riche en nutriments avec les Pokémon affaiblis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon ist sehr friedlich und gütig. Es teilt sein leckeres, nährstoffreiches Öl mit geschwächten Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es pacífico y compasivo. Comparte su delicioso y nutritivo aceite con los Pokémon que han perdido las fuerzas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha un’indole tranquilla ed estremamente compassionevole. Dona il suo olio delizioso e nutriente ai Pokémon debilitati.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This calm Pokémon is very compassionate. It will share its delicious, nutrient-rich oil with weakened Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "穏やかで　とても　慈悲深い。栄養豊富な　美味しい　オイルを弱った　ポケモンに　分け与える。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性情温和，慈悲为怀。会把营养丰富且美味可口的油分享给虚弱的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es pacífico y compasivo. Comparte su delicioso y nutritivo aceite con los Pokémon que han perdido las fuerzas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほうじゅんで　かおりたかい　オイルをがんせきをも　くだく　いきおいではっしゃし　てきを　げきたいする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "진하고 좋은 향이 나는 오일을 암석조차도 꿰뚫어 버릴 기세로 발사하여 적을 물리친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會把香醇濃郁的油以連岩石都能粉碎的力道發射出去，擊退敵人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il repousse ses adversaires en projetant son huile riche en arômes avec suffisamment de force pour pulvériser un rocher.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Feinde schlägt es zurück, indem es duftendes, aromatisches Öl mit einer Wucht abfeuert, die sogar Felsen zertrümmern kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Repele a sus enemigos disparando su exquisito y fragante aceite a una presión que bastaría para partir una roca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Respinge i nemici con un getto del suo olio corposo e profumato, così potente da frantumare anche la roccia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon drives back enemies by launching its rich, aromatic oil at them with enough force to smash a boulder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "芳醇で　香り高い　オイルを岩石をも　砕く　勢いで発射し　敵を　撃退する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会以连岩石都能粉碎的力道把香醇浓郁的油发射出去，击退敌人。",
